Third-party components
----------------------

Panda depends on open-source packages installed separately by the user,
including Typer, Rich, Pydantic, pytest, Ruff, and the Model Context Protocol
Python SDK. Those packages remain under their own licenses and are not bundled
in this repository.

Panda integrates with OpenCode and OpenRouter as external runtimes. They are not
part of this repository and are governed by their own terms and privacy policies.

Corpus content
--------------

This repository contains no corpus data. Test fixtures are synthetic. The Panda
name, the Panda Spark mark, and the Panda mascot are project identifiers; no
trademark registration is claimed.
